/**
 * Static plate for the GPT-2 spectral-mean act (no-WebGL fallback): a layer as a fan of directions,
 * a few strong kept ones above (coral) and many faint discarded ones below, folded onto one steady
 * dotted mean line. The pulse runs mostly through the discarded bundle and on along its ghost paths;
 * the mean line does not answer. The full model's echo (ink) opens in a wide fan to the right; the
 * reduced model's echo (coral) is much weaker, smaller and lopsided, and lands well away from it, in a
 * narrow fan bent down below the output (the mean stand-in leaves a large error).
 * Schematic only. Colours come from the theme's --plate-* custom properties.
 */
